config JIS_OVERRIDE
    bool "Enable independent JIS/ANSI keycode override module"
    default n
    help
      Intercepts specific keycodes at the HID event level (after the
      keymap behavior fires, but before the standard HID listener builds
      the outgoing report) and substitutes the raw keycode that produces
      the correct symbol under a Japanese (JIS) OS keyboard driver.

      This runs entirely independently of keymap bindings (no custom
      mod-morph behavior name appears anywhere in the keymap), so it is
      invisible to — and therefore unaffected by — Keychron Launcher's
      keymap-vocabulary synchronization (which otherwise silently
      replaces unrecognized custom behaviors with &none).
